B.Ow=new A.y("Morning Beach","The sun rises. Kiko invites you for a walk on the beach!","A good morning starts with a cheerful heart.",B.p)
B.N8=new A.y("Trash in the Sand","Plastic bottles are scattered everywhere. The beach is dirty.","Take your trash home \u2014 or use the beach bin.",B.C)
B.La=new A.y("Pretty Shells","Colorful shells wash ashore. Look, but leave them there.","Keep the memory with your eyes, and leave nature as it is.",B.F)
B.P1=new A.y("Running Crab","A little crab runs to the sea. Give it room!","Make way for the smaller and weaker.",B.p)
