B.MW=new A.y("Star Guide","Long ago, sailors used the stars to find their way.","Learn from those before us \u2014 knowledge is a legacy.",B.O)
B.OZ=new A.y("A Comet Passes","A comet passes only once in thousands of years. Lucky to see it!","Be patient for good things \u2014 and thankful when they come.",B.p)
B.NK=new A.y("Space Station","In the tight station, many astronauts live together kindly.","A tight space feels cozy when everyone is polite.",B.p)
B.Na=new A.y("Red Planet","Mars is dusty and cold. The scientists want to understand it.","Curiosity takes people far \u2014 keep it alive.",B.F)
B.OO=new A.y("Asteroid Belt","Many space rocks fly by. The team reminds each other to stay safe.","Remind each other for good \u2014 that shows you care.",B.p)
B.Ox=new A.y("Signal to Earth","Kiko sends good news to his family back on Earth.","Tell your loved ones \u2014 they are always waiting.",B.p)
B.Lu=new A.y("Distant Star","The star we see is really light from long ago.","What you do today can have an effect for a long time.",B.F)
B.No=new A.y("Warm Sun","The sun gives light and energy to the whole Earth.","Bring good to many people, like the sun.",B.p)
B.Pz=new A.y("Ringed Planet","Saturn has lovely rings of ice and rock. Amazing!","Learning makes us admire nature even more.",B.O)
B.Ln=new A.y("Giant Telescope","A giant telescope can see far galaxies. The work of scientists.","Value the hard work of those who advance knowledge.",B.O)
B.OY=new A.y("Meteor Shower","Meteors streak by like falling stars. Kiko makes a good wish.","Make good dreams real with effort, not just hope.",B.F)
B.KN=new A.y("Weather Satellite","A satellite watches the weather, helping farmers and fishermen on Earth.","Knowledge used to help \u2014 that is great knowledge.",B.p)
B.Lo=new A.y("Vast Galaxy","The galaxy is so vast. We are small, but we still matter.","However small you are, your kindness matters.",B.F)
B.MY=new A.y("Rocket Trouble","One part of the rocket breaks. The team fixes it calmly.","Face problems calmly and work together.",B.F)
B.MC=new A.y("Help a Mate","Another astronaut struggles outside the capsule. Kiko lends a hand.","When a friend is in trouble, do not hesitate to help.",B.p)
B.O5=new A.y("Space Mystery","Much in space is still unsolved. Kiko stays curious.","Keep learning without fear \u2014 that is the key to being smart.",B.F)
B.LJ=new A.y("Getting Ready to Go Home","The mission is almost done. Kiko misses his family on Earth.","However great the adventure, home is still special.",B.p)
B.Mo=new A.y("Safe Landing","The rocket lands smoothly thanks to the whole team working together.","Big success is always the result of working together.",B.F)
B.O8=new A.y("Stories to Friends","Kiko shares his space knowledge and stories with his friends.","Share good knowledge \u2014 kindness becomes contagious.",B.p)
B.OU=new A.y("Space Explorer","The last day in outer space. The final boss awaits!","Return to Earth as a better person. That matters most.",B.F)
